# Temporary shims the selfchecks write to run a module whose '@/' imports plain node cannot resolve
# (shippingLabelLayout, invoiceSaysNothingCustomsStops, oneShippingPolicy). They carry a pid suffix and
# are deleted in a finally block — but a crash between writing and deleting leaves one behind, and two
# were caught on their way into a commit.
apps/web/src/utils/.*.selfcheck.*.mjs
